<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transportation by Road Kerala to Assam | Secure Shipping
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes hydraulic ramp trailers safer than traditional car carriers for a Kerala to Assam road shift?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Hydraulic ramp trailers load the vehicle on a level platform using a motor‑driven ramp, eliminating manual lifting and reducing contact points. This method secures the chassis with high‑tensile ratchet lashings and wheel chocks, preventing scratches and dents during the 850 km journey. Combined with GPS tracking and 7‑layer protective packaging, the ramp system offers a superior, zero‑scratch guarantee.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the car transportation by road from Kerala to Assam typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit distance of roughly 850 km via National Highway corridors usually takes 2‑3 days, depending on traffic, weather, and scheduled rest stops. Our route is divided into four legs—Kerala to Karnataka, Karnataka to Odisha, Odisha to West Bengal, and West Bengal to Assam—each with planned checkpoints to ensure timely and safe delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time while it travels from Kerala to Assam?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every truck in our fleet is equipped with satellite‑enabled GPS devices that provide live location updates on a secure portal. Customers receive a unique tracking link, allowing them to monitor progress, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations, ensuring complete transparency throughout the car transportation process.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included for my car during the Kerala‑to‑Assam shipment?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We provide 100 % declared‑value IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance at no extra cost. This policy covers accidental damage, theft, and natural calamities throughout the journey. Detailed insurance documents are shared before dispatch, and claims are processed swiftly in coordination with our claims team.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How do I obtain an accurate quote for car transportation from Kerala to Assam?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Click the ‘Get Assam Shifting Quote’ button, enter your vehicle details, pickup and drop‑off addresses, and any special handling requirements. Our system calculates fuel surcharge, distance‑based rates, insurance, and optional services, delivering a transparent, itemized quote within minutes. You can also request a phone consultation for customized pricing.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any special permits required for moving a car across states from Kerala to Assam?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All inter‑state vehicle transports must comply with the e‑Way bill system and IBA mover code. Our team handles the generation of the e‑Way bill, GST documentation, and any state‑specific permits. We ensure full regulatory compliance, so you do not need to manage paperwork yourself.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What should I look out for to avoid scams when hiring packers and movers for a Kerala‑to‑Assam car shift?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Beware of movers who request upfront cash without a GST invoice, lack ISO certification, or cannot provide a valid vehicle registration number. Verify their IBA approval, read verified Google reviews (our rating is 4.9/5), and confirm they offer IRDAI‑approved insurance. These red flags help you choose a trustworthy partner.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
